# =============================================================================
#  Wonder Woman - Lasso Lash (Q) - 2/2 CRACK  (slot WW_ANIMS.LashCrack)
#  Rig: MrXen0 R15 v1.2  |  60 fps  |  front = +Y  |  UPPER-BODY ONLY (cast while moving / flying)
#
#  HOW TO USE: Blender > Scripting tab > New > paste this whole file > Run Script.
#  - Deletes any previous "WonderWoman_LassoLash_Crack" action first (no leftover keys), resets the
#    pose, sets FK mode, then builds a fresh action and makes it the active one.
#  - Only these bones are keyed: UpTorso, HEAD, FK arm/forearm/hand (L + R).
#    TORSO, legs, feet and root are NOT keyed, so Roblox walk/fly keeps the lower body.
#  - All curves BEZIER + AUTO_CLAMPED, no cycles modifier (one-shot).
#  - Running it twice is safe: you still get exactly one action.
#
#  Game: played at speed 1.4; crackTime 0.20 s -> HIT at f17 (rope tip reaches strikePoint),
#  recoilTime 0.32 s -> server calls track:Stop(0.2) at ~f44; clip ends at rest on f50.
#  Frame map: 0 coil (== Windup last pose) -> 0-8 chest unwinds -> 8-13 elbow drives over
#  the top, hand drags behind -> 13-17 forearm + wrist whip -> 17 HIT (arm at target, wrist
#  snapped down) -> 17-23 follow-through -> 23-35 reel the rope back in -> 35-50 settle to rest.
# =============================================================================
